; Collision refitted 2026-08-14 to the imported art. Hand-authored primitives, NOT derived from
; the art mesh — the distinction ROADMAP's "never touch CollisionShape3D" rule actually guards
; (auto-derived collision is what brings back the capsule seam-freeze class). The pack's houses
; are tall townhouses rather than the graybox's squat 6x4x6 cottages, so the old boxes would have
; left invisible walls standing ~1 m out from the visible walls.
