; VISUAL-ONLY swap — all seven CollisionShape3D pieces below are kept exactly as authored, and
; that is load-bearing. The graybox stable is deliberately OPEN AT THE FRONT (back wall, ends,
; dividers and posts carry collision; there is no front wall) and StableInteract sits at z=-4,
; INSIDE the stable footprint. Collapsing this into one solid box would seal the front and make
; "Greet your steed" physically unreachable — the exact visible-but-unusable class these tests
; exist to catch. The pack stable measures 8.46 x 4.48 x 5.99 at 1.8 against the graybox's
; 9 x 3.5 x 6, so the authored collision still fits the new art closely.
[node name="Mesh" parent="Geometry/Stables" instance=ExtResource("10_stable")]
transform = Transform3D(1.8, 0, 0, 0, 1.8, 0, 0, 0, 1.8, 0, -1.75, 0)

