; Kept named "Mesh" deliberately — tests/helpers/scene_geometry.gd resolves a body through its
; "Mesh" child, so the alignment guards keep seeing this building after the swap. Renaming it is
; exactly the silent-skip failure the harness was hardened against on 2026-08-13.
;
; Scale 1.8 is the pack-wide factor (stable/bell_tower/mill all land on their graybox dimensions
; at 1.8, which is what identified it). y = -2 because the StaticBody3D sits at world y=2 while
; the imported art is base-pivoted.
