; Elder Mishka as the pack's Wizard — the closest read on an elder in this cast.
; y = -1: the Area3D sits at world y=1 (centre of the old 2 m capsule) while the imported
; character is feet-pivoted, so without the offset he floats a metre up. Same trap as the player.
; No Y rotation: these models face +Z natively, which is toward the player's approach here.
; The idle_animator script is what stops him standing in a T-pose.
